{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52570","headline":"卧闻嵩山钟 · 宋之问","name":"卧闻嵩山钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧闻嵩山钟，振衣步蹊樾。\n槁叶零宿雨，新鸿叫晴月。\n物改兴心换，夜凉清机发。\n昔事潘镇人，北岑采[薇]（微）蕨。\n倚岩顾我笑，谓我有仙骨。\n铭德在青春，徇禄去玄发。\n悔往自昭洗，练形归洞窟。\n（同前第一四三五页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}